{
  "name": "Favored Weapon Style",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>This skill only produces an effect when you have a single [One-Handed] weapon equipped to a [Hand Slot]. Your [Attack Power] becomes [Weapon's (Attack Power) x2]. During the first round of a scene, reduce the [Hate] cost of your [Weapon Attacks] by -1 (minimum 0).</p>\n<p>(SR2): Instead of during the first round of a scene, you always apply the [Hate] cost reduction.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A battle style that combines offense and defense, using one-handed weapons to attack and the other to use healing magic.</p>",
